This site is generated from the selected TSLc output tree. C++ declarations are
rendered from Doxygen XML through Breathe. Rust declarations are generated by
Rustdoc and copied into the same browsable site. The Compiler section documents
the ``tslc`` command, architecture, authoring workflow, and supported Python
facade from the checked-out compiler sources.

